"P1435531129" "<em stancevillain2 t=2 d=2><bgcolor DarkMegenta><color white>Vetrano."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P2082332200" "<t=5 d=5><bgcolor DarkMegenta><color white>I should have known you could not resist one last attempt to kill me yourself."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2923215876" "<em point t=5 d=5>Is that all you have to say for yourself, Sinclair?! After everything you've done?!"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P1517078518" "<t=5 d=5><bgcolor DarkMegenta><color white>Your trivial words mean nothing to me. Look around you."
// 6 Caption :
"P4068978697" "<x=0.7 y=0.3 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><bgcolor DarkMegenta><color white>Imperial City burns. The people, when given their freedom, abuse it. You all do not deserve such a luxury."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2252489780" "<em no t=5 d=5>Even after all of this, you still think you're better than all of us. I pity you, Sinclair."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P2651288663" "<t=5 d=5><bgcolor DarkMegenta><color white>Pity. A poor emotion to show in the last moments of your life. Goodbye, Vetrano."
