// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3239013414" "Urgh... I'm sorry, {HeroName}... I can't help you in this...!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3587217270" "Sinclair is using his final fighting style...!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4068008617" "It's time to finish this, Vetrano."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P257427998" "This is not... the end...!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P275695383" "{HeroName}, I considered you an ally once. I will not make the same mistake twice."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1583663508" "{HeroName}. You've come far, but it ends here."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3622029093" "Pathetic. You are a Praetorian, {HeroName}. Where is your pride?!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4233820900" "Look around you. This is what your so-called freedom has brought to Praetoria. Destruction! Chaos!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3678505518" "I stood for order, {HeroName}! You and I, we fought to protect Imperial City! And now it burns, like all of the world!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3014063307" "Was it worth it, {HeroName}? Was the freedom of these people worth the destruction of our world?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P222729348" "Perhaps my time is at an end. Perhaps I was a fool to trust you. But I shall take you down with me!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3394253816" "You shall see my true power before I fall! Praetoria deserves that much!"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P3564914776" "Carnival of Light Mistress"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P891365237" "Get... away...!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2670004752" "You're... manipulating... me... I need... the sword!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P927489433" "It's... I can barely hear anyone... the sword's voice... tells me to ignore you...!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3749230726" "No... it... isn't... I don't want this... give me your aid...!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2334345618" "It's... It's done... I'm free... Free of the sword... free of my hatred... Of my obsession... But what is this...?"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3563716864" "Desdemona... {HeroName}... Thank you. I must go rest, I am sorry I cannot help you any further."
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P3792275255" "Nega-Pendragon"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P169607722" "We will meet again, Pendragon. The Shadowblade does not forget, nor does it forgive. You will be destroyed, one day!"
// Script Variable PET_NAME :
"P3638897958" "Desdemona"
// Script Variable PET_DISPLAY_GROUP :
"P1873324670" "Praetorian Resistance"
// Script Variable SayOnRerescue :
"P2184974686" "Let's continue."
// Script Variable SayOnStranded :
"P1423260460" "Hold on for a moment, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable RescueObjectiveText :
"P2947974141" "Escort Desdemona to Pendragon"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P1580255127" "Pendragon! I am here to break you from the spell of the cursed Excalibur!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3160967407" "Your mad obsession for the sword, combined with Night Ward's corruption, have destroyed both it and yourself. Come to your senses!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2207610719" "I can save you, but only if you're willing! Ask yourself, Pendragon, is this sword the answer to your needs?"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3848912858" "Are you giving up so easily, Pendragon?! Is this your legacy? To give in to the darkness that dwells in your heart, in your mind?"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3968360773" "Then you have it. Pendragon, I rid you of the evils in your heart, of the evils of the Shadowblade!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2365783593" "<em alakazam>"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2484056340" "I must retreat as well, {HeroName}, the ritual has drained my energy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Desdemona 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1533726900" "You've brought Desdemona to Pendragon!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3577515772" "Imperial City has been taken by the Resistance, and Praetor Sinclair has retreated!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4128360286" "Well, we did it, {HeroName}. As we speak, our forces are occupying Imperial City and setting up for the final attack on the Magisterium. Sinclair is still alive, but his pride and control has been shattered. Imperial City was his proudest accomplishment, and now it's <i>gone</i>.<br><br>Pendragon is almost a different person now, and it really gets me thinking about the whole Excalibur thing. That ritual of Desdemona, it cast out not only Nega-Pendragon, but also all of the negativity that was within him. He's almost like some sort of... <i>knight</i> now. Pendragon's obsession over the sword nearly destroyed him, but now, he's better than ever, even without the sword. He's sworn to help us now, saying he's 'honor bound'.<br><br>You and I, in the meantime, are done. We'll be calling on you soon to help in the final fight against Cole. He still has Sinclair, Black Swan, Shadow Hunter, and whatever remains of the IDF with him.<br><br> Without you, {HeroName}, we would've never taken Imperial City. Wherever Tyrant is right now, he's probably <i>regretting</i> every single thing he's done to get to this moment. At least, I can only hope so."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
